linxpad (1.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New application icon (linxpad.png) and alternative glow icon (linxpad-glow.png).
  * Removed linxpad-folder.png icon — folder icons now show a live preview collage of their contents.
  * AppImage fixes: resolved startup failure on Debian and Ubuntu.
  * Touchpad pinch-to-close gesture support.
  * Added /usr/local/share/applications/ to desktop file detection.
  * Added Ubuntu 26.04 package target.
  * Removed Flatpak packaging support.
  * Minor bug fixes and stability improvements.

 -- Andrianos Papamarkou <andrianos@example.com>  Wed, 01 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000

linxpad (1.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bug fix Debian package release.

